    "text": "16 hours ago This week’s snowfall has us thinking about Christmas and one of the best holiday traditions unique to the area. Bob McCarthy’s Irish Christmas certainly puts us all in the holiday season mood. Through the generosity of our friends at Ellicottville Brewing Company, the 20th annual tradition will take place on Friday, December 5th starting at 6:00pm. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
